In research , we recognized that there was a need for websites that had all the necessary information for car services. Even much larger companies did not have a system that allowed you to track the progress of your car until collection and it generally made it difficult for people to be informed and understand costs where some felt like services were overpriced and there was a lack of communication. This made people feel anxious and often unsure if they were truly getting what they were paying for and for people that looked for car services, they could not compare properly, as so many did not have social media presence or web based information especially for those without insurance because they cannot afford it. Our aim was to start a trend that would support local businesses in a more digital manner and create an environment of transparency between the business and client. 
 
