8.2 Stakeholder Needs 
This section records needs identified directly from stakeholder engagement with Mr. Motlokoa Tsotesi (Manager & Mechanic, Mister Auto & Turbo). Findings below are drawn from stakeholder discussion; formal written confirmation (WhatsApp/meeting notes) is attached as Appendix A. 
•SN-01: The stakeholder needs customers to be able to check a vehicle's repair progress without phoning the workshop, since check-in calls interrupt workshop staff during active repair work. 
•SN-02: The stakeholder needs a clear, fixed price reference for common services and parts, to reduce on-thespot negotiation and requests for discounts. 
