	View vehicle status, quotations, notifications and repair history.

Reception/Admin
	Register customers and vehicles, create job cards and manage quotations.

Mechanic
	Update diagnoses, repair progress and job statuses.

Manager/Owner
	View reports, monitor jobs, manage pricing and operations.

Developer
	Maintain and manage critical system functionality.











